Optional Quranic morphology and syntax data
===========================================

ADG-Lang can consume the Quranic Arabic Corpus morphology release v0.4.
Source: https://corpus.quran.com

The underlying Quran text is based on Tanzil Uthmani text v1.0.2.
Source: https://tanzil.net

The raw data is not bundled by default. Distributions that include it or a
substantial derived artifact must also include:
THIRD_PARTY\quranic-arabic-corpus\LICENSE-DATA.txt

ADG-Lang can also verify the syntax resources published in the
author-maintained Quranic Corpus API repository:
https://github.com/kaisdukes/quranic-corpus-api

That repository does not declare a repository license. Its raw syntax and
compact morphology resources are not bundled or redistributed by ADG-Lang.

